# git push origin melete/docs (a project in a subgroup)

### read
GET https://gitlab.com/acme/team/site.git/info/refs?service=git-receive-pack
user-agent: git/2.53.0
accept: */*

### write base64
POST https://gitlab.com/acme/team/site.git/git-receive-pack
user-agent: git/2.53.0
accept: application/x-git-receive-pack-result
content-type: application/x-git-receive-pack-request


